{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196621-scion-cheatsheets","id":1196621,"title":"Scion Cheatsheets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-17T15:16:24-07:00","id":1196621,"title":"Scion Cheatsheets","content":"Hi all, <br /> <br /> I'm getting ready for my upcoming Scion game. Since I won't have a Storyguide Screen for a while, I figured I'd put something together myself. This is primarily Origins, but it's got some additional stuff from Hero, mostly where it ties into the core rules. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1atMeTRnefEOYTNC3u55jFpclWDPudBbQffU6QT4zFWQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1atMeTRnefEOYTNC3u55jFpclWDPudBbQffU6QT4zFWQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1atMeTRnefEOYTNC3u55jFpclWDPudBbQffU6QT4zFWQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1atMeTRnefEOYTNC3u55jFpclWDPudBbQffU6QT4zFWQ/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I've put some work in to add in corrections as they've been provided in the forums, and I've used my judgement in a couple of places where the book is conflicting. There's still some room to expand, so if there's anything crucial missing, let me know. Also, would the Combat Stunts look better in a table? By putting them into a single list, I've already greatly reduced the length, but it might be more useful in a table. <br /> <br /> Feel free to give it a go if you're looking for a Scion resource.<br /> <br /> There's a bit of work to make it into a useful printed resource, I think. I've got a decent sized Band (5 player characters), so I'm currently leaning towards 2 copies of the character creation (1 on the back of the Intrigue, 1 on the Procedural pages), 2 copies of the first two pages (Core rules &amp; Paths) and 2 copies of the combat stuff. Should give us a decent amount of reference material.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2649-tarion","name":"Tarion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T16:01:06-07:00","id":1196632,"title":"","content":"this is an incredible work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T03:26:42-07:00","id":1196758,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElanConnor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1196621-scion-cheatsheets?p=1196632#post1196632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">this is an incredible work.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you. It's good to know my Saturday wasn't wasted. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I've been thinking and at some point I'm going to go through and add in the Origins -&gt; Hero character creation along with something on Purviews (Mostly details on Imbuing versus Spending Legend, and Marvels), and the Boons/Callings you get from advancing your Legend. There's no rush there for my group (I'm running a short Origins preview, which knowing my group means that my initial 3-4 week plan will sprawl over a few months), but I might as well get it done sooner rather than later.<br /> <br /> That and a character sheet (I may just nick the one from the Trinity Manuscript preview and make a few changes) and I should be ready to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2649-tarion","name":"Tarion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T03:54:26-07:00","id":1196761,"title":"","content":"Do you mind posting this to the Discord under the Resources tab?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/258-thesarcasticsage","name":"TheSarcasticSage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T06:27:35-07:00","id":1196776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\